text = "DO NOT SKIP! Welcome to Guardian's Gateway. After this tutorial you will start the game. You will learn how to use starter controls:
Move-WASD
Select/Interact-Left Mouse button
Move Camera-Right Mouse button(hold and drag)
Jump-SPACE bar
Menu-SHIFT
Back-ESC
Now that you know the basics you will learn more in the future of the game. 
If you need to revisit this go to the tutorial section in the menu.
Now go have fun not causing any trouble."

